# Pizza Area Calculator

diameter = float(input("Enter pizza diameter: "))

radius = diameter / 2
area = 3.14 * (radius ** 2)

print("Pizza Area =", area)
input() hamesha string return karta hai.
float() se input ko number mein convert (typecasting) kiya gaya hai.
Radius = Diameter ÷ 2

Formula:

Area = 3.14 × (radius ** 2)
** ka matlab power (square) hota hai.
rogram user se pizza ka diameter leta hai, float() se typecasting karta hai, phir formula Area = 3.14 × (diameter / 2)² use karke pizza ka total area calculate aur print karta hai.
